From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 16:45:53 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 374/443] [ae-patch] Switching the default Claude login moves
 every chat, with no question

The default-login pick used to ask "Move all open chats?" and Only new chats left every chat on the old login; archived chats were never listed and mid-reply chats were skipped for good. The pick now calls move-all at once and shows one toast; the move-all route also covers archived chats and retries a busy chat until its reply ends. The AeMoveAllChatsDialog, its store and its tests are removed.
